 You\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 do\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 know\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 you\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 are\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 more\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 than\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 that,\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 don't\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 you?\f97\expnd0\expndtw0 ”\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-184\slmult0\fs18 \par\pard\li104\sl-280\slmult0\f19\fs28\charscalex99 7.\charscalex100  \expnd0\expndtw1  \f97\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex99 “\f19\expnd0\expndtw-2 How\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 do\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 you\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 know\expnd0\expndtw0 ?\f97 ”\charscalex100 \par\pard\li554\sl-280\slmult0\sb52\f19\fs28\charscalex99 Anchors the change to the client's reality strategy.\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-294\slmult0\fs28 \par\pard\li5154\sl-200\slmult0\f19\fs20\expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw-2 h\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 NLP\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Mas\expnd0\expndtw-2 t\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd0\expndtw-2 r \expnd0\expndtw0 P\expnd0\expndtw-2 r\expnd0\expndtw0 ac\expnd0\expndtw-2 titi\expnd0\expndtw0 o\expnd-1\expndtw-3 n\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd0\expndtw-2 r \expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw-2 r\expnd0\expndtw0 aining\expnd0\expndtw-2 ,  \expnd0\expndtw0 July\expnd0\expndtw-2 , \expnd0\expndtw0 2004\par\pard\li3695\sl-240\slmult0\sb8\f19\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Copy\expnd0\expndtw-2 r\expnd0\expndtw0 ight \f60\