\li1066\sl-480\slmult0\f53\fs48\expnd0\expndtw-2 LINGUISTIC\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 PARTS\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 INTEGRATION\expnd0\expndtw0 \par\pard\li104\ri457\sl-330\slmult0\sb62\f19\fs28\expnd-1\expndtw-3\charscalex99 T\expnd0\expndtw0 his pattern can be useful in integrating Parts.  Here’s how you would\f19  resolve a Part’s conflict using Prime Concerns.\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-172\slmult0\fs16 \par\pard\li104\sl-280\slmult0\f19\fs28\charscalex99 Process for Integrating Parts:\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-167\slmult0\fs16 \par\pard\li104\sl-280\slmult0\f21\fs28\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex99 1.  Discover the Function/Behavior for Each Part:\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-122\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li104\ri458\sl-330\slmult0\f19\fs28\charscalex99 “What is the behavior of the Part, or what is the function that the Part\f19  \expnd0\expndtw-2 plays?”\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-167\slmult0\fs16 \par\pard\li104\sl-280\slmult0\f21\fs28\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex99 2.  Discover the Purpose/Intention of the Behavior:\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-122\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li104\ri1302\sl-330\slmult0\f19\fs28\charscalex99 “What is the purpose of this behavior?  What is the intent of the\f19  \expnd0\expndtw-2 behavior?”\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-167\slmult0\fs16 \par\pard\li104\sl-280\slmult0\f21\fs28\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex99 3.  Make sure the Learning’s are Preserved:\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-122\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li104\ri572\sl-330\slmult0\f19\fs28\charscalex99 “What is there to learn from the behavior?” (Handle the ecology of the\f19  integration.)\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-167\slmult0\fs16 \par\pard\li104\sl-280\slmult0\f21\fs28\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex99 4. Switch the Purpose/Intention of One Part to the other:\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-122\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li104\ri623\qj\sl-330\slmult0\f19\fs28\charscalex99 Take the intention from part A and talk about it as though it was the\f19  intention of part B, while at the same time talking about the original\f19  intention for Part A and the original intention for Part B.\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-191\slmult0\fs18 \par\pard\li4133\ri4471\qc\sl-240\slmult0\f97\fs24 Swap Intentions\par\pard\sect\sectd\sbknone\marglsxn1480\margrsxn600\cols2\colno1\colw2471\colsr2625\colno2\colw5064\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-224\slmult0\fs22 \par\pard
