\li1618\sl-360\slmult0\f90\fs36\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2 Elements\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 of\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 an\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Effective\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Motivation\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Strategy\b0\expnd0\expndtw0 \par\pard\li104\sl-240\slmult0\sb47\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 1\expnd0\expndtw0 .   \expnd2\expndtw8  \expnd0\expndtw0 Voice (if present) has good tonality.\par\pard\li644\fi-540\ri1326\sl-280\slmult0\sb7\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 2\expnd0\expndtw0 .   \expnd2\expndtw8  \expnd0\expndtw0 Voice uses modal operators of possibility, desire or choice rather than\f30  necessity.\par\pard\li644\fi-540\ri179\sl-280\slmult0\sb7\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 3\expnd0\expndtw0 .   \expnd2\expndtw8  \expnd0\expndtw0 Includes a representation of what is desirable about the task (the completion or\f30  consequences) rather than a representation of the process of doing the task.\par\pard\li104\sl-240\slmult0\sb47\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 4\expnd0\expndtw0 .   \expnd2\expndtw8  \expnd0\expndtw-2 The\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 task\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 is\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 chunked\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 appropriately.\expnd0\expndtw0 \par\pard\li644\fi-540\ri972\sl-280\slmult0\sb7\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 5\expnd0\expndtw0 .   \expnd2\expndtw8  \expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw0 oward strategies are more enjoyable and result in less stress than away\f30  strategies.\par\pard\li104\sl-240\slmult0\sb47\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 6\expnd0\expndtw0 .   \expnd2\expndtw8  \expnd0\expndtw0 Toward, away and mixed strategies work; mixed is the most general.\par\pard\li104\sl-240\slmult0\sb47\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 7\expnd0\expndtw0 .   \expnd2\expndtw8  \expnd0\expndtw0 If mixed, think of negative first and then positive.\par\pard\li644\fi-540\ri251\qj\sl-280\slmult0\sb7\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 8\expnd0\expndtw0 .   \expnd2\expndtw8  \expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw0 ry to replace away with toward strategy.  Set frame that “if you do not learn a\f30  new strategy you will have to feel bad over and over again in the future”  which\f30  uses their  current  strategy of moving away.\par\pard\li104\sl-240\slmult0\sb47\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 9\expnd0\expndtw0 .   \expnd2\expndtw8  \expnd0\expndtw0 Association and dissociation are critical elements.\par\pard\li104\sl-240\slmult0\sb47\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 10\expnd0\expndtw0 . \expnd2\expndtw12  \expnd0\expndtw0 Good strategies work across contexts.\par\pard\li104\sl-240\slmult0\sb47\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 11\expnd0\expndtw0 . \expnd2\expndtw12  \expnd0\expndtw0 Always check ecology before removing negative feelings or anxiety.\par\pard\li644\fi-540\ri640\sl-280\slmult0\sb7\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 12\expnd0\expndtw0 . \expnd2\expndtw12  \expnd0\expndtw0 It may be necessary to adjust the submodalities of the representation of the\f30  task being done in order to get a strongly motivated response.\par\pard\li644\fi-540\ri241\sl-280\slmult0\sb7\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 13\expnd0\expndtw0 . \expnd2\expndtw12  \expnd0\expndtw0 If representing the task as completed does not produce strong motivation, then\f30  focus on the consequences.\par\pard\li104\sl-240\slmult0\sb47\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 14\expnd0\expndtw0 . \expnd2\expndtw12  \expnd0\expndtw0 Procrastinators are often good planners.\par\pard\sl-160\slmult0\fs16 \par\pard\li104\sl-240\slmult0\f20\fs24\b1 Example of a Good Motivational Strategy:\b0 \par\pard\sl-135\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li103\ri340\sl220\slmult0\f30\fs24\expnd0\expndtw-2 A\expnd0\expndtw0\dn8 d\up0  in pleasant voice “It will be so good when it is done.” leading to visual construct\f30  of completed task of positive consequences leading to a positive K\par\pard\li103\sl-240\slmult0\sb60\f30\fs24 leading to beginning the task or future pacing appropriately.\par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-112\slmult0\fs10 \par\pard\li5154\sl-200\slmult0\f30\fs20\expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw-2 h\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 NLP\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Mas\expnd0\expndtw-2 t\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd0\expndtw-2 r \expnd0\expndtw0 P\expnd0\expndtw-2 r\expnd0\expndtw0 ac\expnd0\expndtw-2 titi\expnd0\expndtw0 o\expnd-1\expndtw-3 n\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd0\expndtw-2 r \expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw-2 r\expnd0\expndtw0 aining\expnd0\expndtw-2 ,  \expnd0\expndtw0 July\expnd0\expndtw-2 , \expnd0\expndtw0 2004\par\pard\li3695\sl-240\slmult0\sb8\f30\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Copy\expnd0\expndtw-2 r\expnd0\expndtw0 ight \f47\charscalex107 ©\f30\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex100  \expnd0\expndtw0 1987-2004\expnd0\expndtw-2 , \expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw0 ad\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 James\expnd0\expndtw-2 , \expnd0\expndtw0 Advanced\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Neu\expnd0\expndtw-2 r\expnd0\expndtw0 o\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Dynamics\par\pard\sect\sectd\sbkpage\marglsxn1480\margrsxn600\margtsxn760\cols2\colno1\colw8441\colsr139\colno2\colw1580\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-228\slmult0\fs22 \par\pard
