ad feelings.\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-122\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li643\fi-540\ri412\sl-330\slmult0\f30\fs28\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex99 4\expnd0\expndtw0 .\charscalex100   \expnd2\expndtw9  \f20\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex99 Caution\expnd0\expndtw0 :\f30\b0   \expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw0 here are some things that one should move away from.\f30  Be careful about removing away strategies entirely.  It is better to\f30  design a strategy with both elements.\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-260\slmult0\fs26 \par\pard
