 needs to go external to get necessary data.\f30  \expnd0\expndtw-2 c\expnd0\expndtw0 )\charscalex100    \expnd9\expndtw43  \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex99 Options and criteria are not revised according to\charscalex100 \par\pard\li1544\sl-280\slmult0\sb52\f30\fs28\charscalex99 circumstances.\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-167\slmult0\fs16 \par\pard\li104\sl-280\slmult0\f20\fs28\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex99 3.   Problems with evaluating options.\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 \par\pard\li914\ri3281\sl-330\slmult0\sb2\f30\fs28\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex99 a\expnd0\expndtw0 )\charscalex100    \expnd5\expndtw26  \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex99 Criteria for selection are inappropriate.\f30  \expnd0\expndtw-2 b\expnd0\expndtw0 )\charscalex100    \expnd3\expndtw16  \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex99 Criteria are not prioritized.\charscalex100 \par\pard\li1544\fi-630\ri726\sl-330\slmult0\sb2\f30\fs28\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex99 c\expnd0\expndtw0 )\charscalex100    \expnd9\expndtw43  \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex99 Criteria are considered sequentially and separately rather\f30  than simultaneously.  Polarity response is an example.\charscalex100 \par\pard\li914\sl-280\slmult0\sb52\f30\fs28\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex99 d\expnd0\expndtw0 )\charscalex100    \expnd3\expndtw16  \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex99 Person does not get an overall evaluation of each criterion.\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-102\slmult0\fs10 \par\pard\li5154\sl-200\slmult0\f30\fs20\expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw-2 h\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 NLP\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Mas\expnd0\expndtw-2 t\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd0\expndtw-2 r \expnd0\expndtw0 P\expnd0\expndtw-2 r\expnd0\expndtw