\li2852\sl-360\slmult0\f90\fs36\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2 Well\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Formedness\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Conditions\b0\expnd0\expndtw0 \par\pard\sl-360\slmult0\sb14 \column \f26\fs36 Six\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 …\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 17\par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-273\slmult0\fs26 \par\pard\sect\sectd\sbknone\marglsxn1480\margrsxn600\sl-294\slmult0\fs28 \par\pard\li635\fi-517\ri637\sl-280\slmult0\f30\fs24 1.   \expnd-6\expndtw-28  \expnd0\expndtw0 Begin in a positive state.  \expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw0 hink of a time when you succeeded and felt good\f30  rather than failed and felt bad.  Access and anchor appropriate resources.\par\pard\sl-126\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li635\fi-517\ri223\sl-280\slmult0\f30\fs24 2.   \expnd-6\expndtw-28  \expnd0\expndtw0 Chunk appropriately.  Chunk down the task to avoid overwhelm.  Recycle or go\f30  external until you can represent the smaller chunks so as to sequence and\f30  prioritize them.\par\pard\sl-166\slmult0\fs16 \par\pard\li118\sl-240\slmult0\f30\fs24 3.   \expnd-6\expndtw-28  \expnd0\expndtw0 Get appropriate feedback relative to the task being learned.\par\pard\sl-126\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li635\fi-517\ri420\sl-280\slmult0\f30\fs24 4.   \expnd-6\expndtw-28  \expnd0\expndtw0 Make appropriate comparisons that give one a feeling of accomplishment.  Do\f30  not make comparisons to expert or to an ideal self but to your ability in the\f30  past.\par\pard\sl-126\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li635\fi-517\ri206\sl-280\slmult0\f30\fs24 5.   \expnd-6\expndtw-28  \expnd0\expndtw0 Exit.  Avoid the dangers of exiting too soon or never exiting.  Exit when you\f30  have  learned enough for right now, and when you have learned something well\f30  enough for your outcome.  Avoid the trap of chasing clarity.  All important\f30  decisions are made on the basis of insufficient information.\par\pard\sl-126\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li635\fi-517\ri242\qj\sl-280\slmult0\f30\fs24 6.   \expnd-6\expndtw-28  \expnd0\expndtw0 Expect to not understand some things.  Set them aside and come back to them\f30  later.  Do not get trapped in bad feelings about not understanding.  Remember\f30  that understanding is a feeling.\par\pard\sl-126\slmult0\fs12 \par\pard\li635\fi-517\ri799\sl-280\slmult0\f30\fs24 7.   \expnd-6\expndtw-28  \expnd0\expndtw0 Know your Submodality equivalents of understanding and use them to get\f30  information in the necessary form.\par\pard\sl-166\slmult0\fs16 \par\pard\li118\sl-240\slmult0\f30\fs24 8.   \expnd-6\expndtw-28  \expnd0\expndtw0 Future pace learning to the time and place that they will be needed.\par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-140\slmult0\fs14 \par\pard
