\li3292\sl-360\slmult0\f90\fs36\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2 Good\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Spelling\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Strategy\b0\expnd0\expndtw0 \par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb7\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 Asked to spell the word - may repeat it internally.\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 See the word - visual remembered - may defocus rapidly - ask to spell backwards\par\pard\li464\sl-240\slmult0\sb47\f30\fs24 - rapid.\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 Feeling of familiarity or not  -  look for shift in breathing or gestures.\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 How good a speller they are depends on what they read.\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 If no feeling of familiarity do a visual construct until get feeling.\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 Secondary strategy for words for which no memory image exists.\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 Final K is a motivator for continual improvement.\par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-187\slmult0\fs18 \par\pard\li5154\sl-200\slmult0\f30\fs20\expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw-2 h\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 NLP\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Mas\expnd0\expndtw-2 t\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd0\expndtw-2 r \expnd0\expndtw0 P\expnd0\expndtw