\li3576\sl-360\slmult0\f90\fs36\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2 Spelling\expnd0\expndtw0  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Instalation\b0\expnd0\expndtw0 \par\pard\sl-293\slmult0\fs28 \par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 “Do you have any objections to being a good speller?”\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 New strategy is only for the context of spelling.\par\pard\sl-360\slmult0\sb14 \column \f26\fs36 Six\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 …\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 19\par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-294\slmult0\fs28 \par\pard\sect\sectd\sbknone\marglsxn1480\margrsxn600\li464\fi-360\ri304\sl-280\slmult0\sb16\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 New strategy will not result in instantly being an expert speller but will result in\f30  rapid improvement.\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 Check for reverse wiring.\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 “Can you think of a good friend?”\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 Simplest method is rehearsing.\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 Reframe only if necessary.\par\pard\li464\fi-360\ri263\qj\sl-280\slmult0\sb16\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 “I am going to give you a word.  As soon as I do, look up here (hold hand in their\f30  visual remember), allow an image of the word to appear, and as soon as it does,\f30  look down here (hold hand in their K)  to get a feeling of familiarity or not.”\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 Use simple words initially.\par\pard\li104\sl-290\slmult0\sb6\f47\fs24\charscalex131 •\f37\charscalex100    \expnd2\expndtw9  \f30\expnd0\expndtw0 Have them spell words in reverse.\par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-140\slmult0\fs14 \par\pard
