\par}}}}\li103\sl-220\slmult0\f30\fs22\charscalex98 So, Craig, I love your dishwasher, where'd you get it? (Sears.)\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-200\slmult0\fs20 \par\pard\sl-240\slmult0\fs24 \par\pard\li104\ri716\qj\sl-260\slmult0\f30\fs22\charscalex98 Now, notice that Craig moves his eyes up and to the left, then to the right, and then he\f30  m\expnd0\expndtw-2 o\expnd0\expndtw0 ve\expnd0\expndtw-2 d\expnd0\expndtw0  them \expnd0\expndtw-2 do\expnd0\expndtw0 wn an\expnd0\expndtw-2 d\expnd0\expndtw0  t\expnd0\expndtw-2 o\expnd0\expndtw0  the right an\expnd0\expndtw-2 d\expnd0\expndtw0  then t\expnd0\expndtw-2 o\expnd0\expndtw0  the left (as y\expnd0\expndtw-2 ou\expnd0\expndtw0  l\expnd0\expndtw-2 ook\expnd0\expndtw0  at him).  \expnd-1\expndtw-3 T\expnd0\expndtw0 hen he's\f30  \expnd0\expndtw-2 done.\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 \par\pard\sl-263\slmult0\fs26 \par\pard
